              "value": "Corner Of The Eye"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(illusion, mental, primal, visual)\n\nThe ocluai creates a wave of disturbing illusory images in a 10-foot burst centered on a point within 60 feet. Any creature caught in this burst takes 3d6 mental damage (DC 20 basic Will save) as their peripheral vision churns with terrifying visions of worm-eaten corpses and monsters ready to pounce."
